# v0.6.0 Planning Attachment

Release focus: make the existing v0.5 Data Vault API easier to use without hiding Data Vault semantics.

Recommended execution order:

1. Design the fluent Code-First API contract.
2. Implement hub/satellite/link projection and schema parity tests.
3. Add the immutable model registry and service integration.
4. Add typed explicit save/read helpers.
5. Add diagnostics and examples.
6. Update README and release notes.

Guardrails:

- Do not introduce SaveChanges interception in v0.6.0.
- Preserve all v0.5 public APIs.
- Keep load timestamp and record source explicit.
- Use provider-neutral behavior first; provider-specific enhancements must remain optional.
